<title>VENEZUELA: Ceramica Carabobo Q2 down 60 pct.</title>
<headline>Ceramica Carabobo Q2 down 60 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q2 1997		   Q2 1996</p>
<p>    Net profit	    702.7 million bolivars     1.78 bln</p>
<p>    Net sales		11.33 bln bolivars    14.56 bln</p>
<p>    Cost of sales	   8.27 bln bolivars    10.12 bln</p>
<p>    Administrative costs  1.09 bln bolivars     2.10 bln</p>
<p>NOTE: Results to period ending March 31 are consolidated and inflation-adjusted, but not audited.</p>
<p>Ceramica Carabobo manufactures ceramic products.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
